 Record design decisions, hypotheses, review findings, and unresolved questions here.
 Imported associated notes retain original evidence/timestamps in `evidence/associated_notes.jsonl`.
+
+## Current bounded domain audit
+
+The existing input-color-8 finding remains actionable for generator SHA-256
+`2f041639dc57ad47a5c4581aa23599526a1878ed79f881b23a1998c574338fe7`.
+The canonical task has two visible demonstrations without input 8 and one query
+with input colors 8 and 9. A concrete rival that ignores input 8, otherwise
+intersecting the two color boxes, fits both demonstrations but predicts a blank
+query output. Protected canonical Racket produces a 15-cell cyan intersection.
+The current `self_check` rejects this valid query because it excludes input 8.
+
+`workspace/audit_canonical_domain.py` reproduces this with canonical Racket
+hash `f9a51da365cc`; all three canonical recorded outputs match execution.
+Three production controls (seed 17, sample indices 0/1/2, easy/medium/hard)
+also fit the rival and pass the current self-check. Source inspection shows the
+palette excludes 8 and 1; normal draws use exactly two diagonal points per
+color. This is a generator support gap at a canonical query, not evidence that
+two conflicting labels occur within current generated episodes.
+
+Evidence is retained in `counterexamples/current-domain-audit/` and the packet
+check output `checks/de45fc71c193/canonical-domain/`. Reproduce from packet root:
+
+```bash
+WORK/.venv/bin/python review.py run ../.venv/bin/python generators/de45fc71c193/workspace/audit_canonical_domain.py --out ../checks/de45fc71c193/canonical-domain-rerun
+```
+
+Recommended repair: allow input 8 in the two-color bbox domain, generate it in
+source palettes, include examples that discriminate the rival, and reconcile
+the stale summary with the canonical rule's blank-background output. Generator
+and SUMMARY currently claim original colored cells remain, whereas canonical
+Racket discards them outside the overlap. Broader box representations and the
+advertised control/degenerate behavior still need an owner-selected scope.
+No production code or audit disposition was changed. This audit ran six inputs,
+no battery, and no native parametric work; the three production draws are not a
+statistical coverage estimate.
